#OBSD
>> dirname := [''].
{ dirname fi-kun-opin: ['X/']. } * (1024 / 2 - 4).
>> command := ['mkdir -p /tmp/'] + dirname.
Eto eto-iṣẹ: command.
Eto chdir: ['/tmp/'] + dirname.
>> filename := [''].
{ filename fi-kun-opin: ['YYYYYYYY']. } * 20.
Faili tuntun: filename, kọ: ['sometext'].
{ Faili akojọ: ['/tmp/'] + dirname. } * 1000.
Ijade kọ: ['no crash'], ila-tuntun.

